Oral Fluid and Saliva Drug Testing comprises products and systems that analyse saliva specimens for rapid screening or confirmation of drugs of abuse such as cannabinoids, amphetamines, opiates, cocaine metabolites, benzodiazepines and methadone. Typical formats include collection swabs, integrated test devices, buffer solutions and reader instruments; advantages stem from non‑invasive sampling, observable collection, ease of on‑site deployment and suitability for roadside enforcement, workplace screening, forensic investigations and selected medical contexts.
